usage: check-adjacency-overlap.py [-h] (--revision REVISION | --selftest)
                                  [--repo REPO]
                                  [--siblings-root SIBLINGS_ROOT]

Count anchored rows of the round-27 mori overlap register (claim C2). Git
subprocesses, including selftest fixtures, use the round-30 child-environment
contract.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --revision REVISION
  --selftest
  --repo REPO
  --siblings-root SIBLINGS_ROOT
